*.out
*.err

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CODE/DATA BOUNDARY (see CLAUDE.md). This repo holds CODE ONLY — all data,
# derivatives, caches, features, QC outputs, cohort files, analysis outputs,
# plots, models and results live on Oak under
#   /oak/stanford/groups/ckeller1/data/iEEG_EHR/derivatives/sisler/
# These patterns are a BACKSTOP, not the mechanism: the correct behaviour is
# that nothing writes data into the repo in the first place.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

